# Intentionally contains no variable assignments.
#
# Cloudflare's Deploy to Cloudflare flow treats keys in .env.example as
# Worker deployment secrets and asks users to fill them during first deploy.
# This dashboard does not require any Worker secret to boot, so initial
# Cloudflare deployment stays zero-config.
#
# For local/Docker monitor configuration, use:
#   cp monitor.env.example .env
#
# RESET_STATUS_URL is also optional for the Worker. A fork can deploy first
# and add that runtime variable later to point at its own monitor-state/status.json.
